From ce6fa6f38a07b766a0795bed7a1995384e759499 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valera <valera@example.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:42:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher3: Add kill app button in Overview task cards

- Style task dismiss button in top-right corner to match app chip (36dp, Material Surface background, ripple, cross icon)
- Force stop app process and remove task on tap
- Grant FORCE_STOP_PACKAGES privileged permission to com.android.launcher3

Change-Id: Iecabe6c0aceb5ef2a92586eb5f1bc5fa3532c518
---
 com.android.launcher3-extra.xml               |  1 +
 quickstep/AndroidManifest.xml                 |  1 +
 quickstep/res/layout/task_dismiss_button.xml  | 33 ++++++----
 .../com/android/quickstep/views/TaskView.kt   | 62 +++++++++----------
 res/drawable/ic_close_app_chip.xml            | 28 +++++++++
 res/drawable/task_dismiss_button_bg.xml       | 20 ++++++
 6 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 res/drawable/ic_close_app_chip.xml
 create mode 100644 res/drawable/task_dismiss_button_bg.xml

